OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry with
OL,6,Fclear skies to start the night,
OL,7,Fhowever cloud will increase from the
OL,8,Fsouth after midnight, with a risk of
OL,9,Fpatchy rain in the south by dawn.
OL,10,FSoutheasterly winds strengethening
OL,11,Fovernight.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTuesday:FA blustery day ahead with
OL,14,Fstrongest gusts over high ground.
OL,15,FCloudy initially with an odd spot of
OL,16,Frain possible, although brighter
OL,17,Fspells developing. Rain arriving
OL,18,Fovernight. Feeling warm and muggy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
