OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FA wet
OL,6,Fand windy start to Wednesday, but this
OL,7,Fclearing to sunshine and showers.
OL,8,FTurning more settled from Thursday
OL,9,Fwith more dry and bright weather.
OL,10,FWinds also easing.
